1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 13)

3
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,719
Since this is your heart，

4
00:01:59,633 --> 00:02:01,193
how could I bear to wash it off?

5
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:04,159
How could I bear to lose it again?

6
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,760
What's gone is gone.

7
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:10,360
Stealing this half an
hour is enough for me.

8
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,840
So stop clinging to Mr. Ji.

9
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,879
He has his own life.

10
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,360
I'm leaving tomorrow.

11
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,240
Mr. Ji, you should head back too.

12
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,639
You'd better wash that thing off your hand.

13
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:29,399
I don't want to cause you trouble.

14
00:02:29,879 --> 00:02:31,519
And I don't want others to misunderstand.

15
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:34,159
Who would misunderstand?

16
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:37,159
What trouble could it cause me?

17
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:40,817
Even though Mrs. Ji isn't here, but...

18
00:02:40,841 --> 00:02:42,280
Who said I'm already married?

19
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,840
You're not?

20
00:02:54,039 --> 00:02:55,680
If I were already married,

21
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,400
how could this seat still be empty?

22
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:01,319
Then Xiao Ning is...?

23
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:06,639
Can't the father of a
three-year-old still be single?

24
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,919
Of course that's possible too.

25
00:03:10,159 --> 00:03:11,559
Like having a child out of wedlock.

26
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:13,240
Like he's already divorced.

27
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,240
Or maybe...

28
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:28,319
Shen Mo...

29
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,080
Speak.

30
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,879
There is no Mrs. Ji.

31
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,400
And even if there were,

32
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,719
there could only be the one before my eyes.

33
00:03:50,199 --> 00:03:51,479
I've had the best.

34
00:03:53,479 --> 00:03:55,520
How could I bear to lose him again?

35
00:03:58,759 --> 00:03:59,759
Why?

36
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:04,560
In this world there is only one thing that
no matter how you hide it, can't be hidden.

37
00:04:05,639 --> 00:04:07,000
Even if you never say a word

38
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:10,240
one look will give it away.

39
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:32,879
Mr. Ji.

40
00:04:51,879 --> 00:04:52,879
Too slow.

41
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,040
Call me.

42
00:05:14,759 --> 00:05:15,759
Mingxuan.

43
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,519
Mingxuan.

44
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,720
I want it.

45
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:28,079
Louder.

46
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:40,199
I want it.

47
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,160
I want it.

48
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,560
Mingxuan.

49
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,560
Mingxuan.

50
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,959
Now you're mine.

51
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:16,519
Always have been.

52
00:06:34,279 --> 00:06:35,279
Mr. Ji

53
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,560
You really never got married?

54
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,879
You know who's in my heart.

55
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,879
If that's the case

56
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:48,199
why did you disappear four years ago?

57
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:51,560
I had Lawyer Chen reach out to you.

58
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:53,600
Why did you never reply?

59
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,720
Ah.

60
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,920
It's all my fault.

61
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:08,079
That day, An'an woke up in the hospital.

62
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:11,920
After hearing the whole truth from me

63
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:15,319
she didn't shed a single tear.

64
00:07:18,032 --> 00:07:19,832
An'an has been a
crybaby since she was little.

65
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:23,480
But that time she was eerily calm.

66
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,000
After she woke up

67
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,959
she asked me for just one thing.

68
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:33,759
What was it?

69
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:35,199
Ever since we were kids,

70
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:37,920
whatever An'an wanted,

71
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:40,839
I'd do my best to give it to her.

72
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,800
I hated Zhou Yang so much

73
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:48,399
and still agreed to let
him be my brother-in-law.

74
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:55,000
It was the first time An'an
begged me so sincerely.

75
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:59,120
I couldn't let her down.

76
00:08:04,439 --> 00:08:05,439
Brother.

77
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:08,759
Let Shen go.

78
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:11,279
Okay.

79
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,319
Let Shen and Yang be together.

80
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,920
An'an.

81
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:24,399
So you and...

82
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,480
Yang.

83
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,199
Actually.

84
00:08:28,639 --> 00:08:29,839
I've felt it for a while.

85
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:31,759
Yang doesn't love me like he used to.

86
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,000
That's enough, An'an.

87
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,320
Don't think about this now.

88
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,360
Brother.

89
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:38,799
I'm fine.

90
00:08:42,519 --> 00:08:43,519
Actually.

91
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:46,799
Back then it was you who
insisted on tying Yang to my side.

92
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:50,360
I've figured it out now.

93
00:08:51,879 --> 00:08:54,480
Only two people who love
each other should be together.

94
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:59,872
The one who isn't
loved can only let go.

95
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,399
An'an.

96
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,840
That's how it is for me.

97
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:10,039
And it's the same for you, Brother.

98
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,720
Okay.

99
00:09:15,159 --> 00:09:16,159
I promise you.

100
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,159
I'll let Mo go free.

101
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,960
I'll never bother Mo again.

102
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,960
Or Yang.

103
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:32,159
You said I was lovesick.

104
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,960
Looks like you are too.

105
00:09:44,113 --> 00:09:45,113
It was obvious...

106
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:50,960
It was obvious that everyone lied to her.

107
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:55,159
Yet she understood much
more clearly than me, right?

108
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:57,960
I thought

109
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,319
if you tie two people together

110
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:02,159
feelings would come sooner or later.

111
00:10:05,279 --> 00:10:06,799
But it backfired.

112
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:09,600
I told them about you and Yang.

113
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:12,320
And it got you hurt.

114
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:17,679
I set An'an up to marry Yang.

115
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,120
And it got her hurt.

116
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,440
No.

117
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,639
I know you meant no harm.

118
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:32,879
But what's done is done.

119
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,120
It can't be changed.

120
00:10:38,039 --> 00:10:39,960
So I never contacted you again.

121
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:43,000
Vanished from your life completely.

122
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:44,600
I thought...

123
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,759
you and Zhou Yang would make up.

124
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,639
Zhou Yang and I

125
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:55,039
ended things long ago.

126
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,480
I should have believed you.

127
00:10:58,639 --> 00:11:01,120
I never expected to run
into you here that day.

128
00:11:04,519 --> 00:11:06,039
That day you were right by the pool.

129
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,759
Just standing there.

130
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:16,799
Mo.

131
00:11:19,919 --> 00:11:21,360
You walked right into the trap.

132
00:11:23,879 --> 00:11:24,879
Yes.

133
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,720
And who set that trap?

134
00:11:29,279 --> 00:11:30,519
None other than Mr. Ji.

135
00:11:32,519 --> 00:11:34,120
To set this trap, Mr. Ji

136
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:36,840
went so far as to open
this hotel on M Island.

137
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:39,200
Waiting for me to walk right in.

138
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:42,360
Just like back then at
Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

139
00:11:48,519 --> 00:11:50,360
Are you going back to
keep Xiao Ning company?

140
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,560
Stay in bed with me a little longer.

141
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,320
Mm.

142
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,679
If Mr. Ji isn't married,

143
00:11:59,759 --> 00:12:00,759
then Xia Ning is...

144
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,720
Back home.

145
00:12:03,639 --> 00:12:08,200
I suppose in all these years, you've
also heard the news about An'an.

146
00:12:08,759 --> 00:12:09,759
Mm.

147
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,559
Lawyer Chen mentioned it.

148
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,759
After An'an and I went abroad

149
00:12:18,799 --> 00:12:20,759
her condition had stabilized.

150
00:12:24,519 --> 00:12:25,519
But she

151
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:26,919
wouldn't listen to me.

152
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,360
She insisted on having Ji Ning.

153
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:35,879
Just like

154
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,559
my mother back then.

155
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,440
Xiao Ning is...?

156
00:12:44,879 --> 00:12:46,159
Miss Ji's child?

157
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:49,039
Ji An'an was three years ago.

158
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,080
Ji Ning is three now.

159
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:53,000
But

160
00:12:53,399 --> 00:12:54,679
the child's father?

161
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:57,279
So Xiao Ning's birth father is...?

162
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,399
Zhou Yang?

163
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:00,559
Ji Ning's surname is Ji.

164
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,879
He has nothing to do with anyone else.

165
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,960
That's what An'an wanted too.

166
00:13:12,559 --> 00:13:14,679
An'an must love Xiao Ning very much.

167
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,159
But to me

168
00:13:17,919 --> 00:13:19,519
it's just too cruel.

169
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,360
You still have me.

170
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,159
I've always been here.

171
00:14:00,039 --> 00:14:01,279
I'm getting ready to head back.

172
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:02,879
Mm.

173
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,440
Are you leaving today?

174
00:14:07,679 --> 00:14:09,399
I'll go cancel the flight ticket right now.

175
00:14:14,279 --> 00:14:15,319
These next couple of days.

176
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,080
I'll show you around.

177
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,080
Stay a couple more days.

178
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,360
Okay.

179
00:14:27,519 --> 00:14:29,199
Wait for me at the hotel entrance at noon.

180
00:14:30,220 --> 00:14:31,259
We'll go eat.

181
00:14:33,499 --> 00:14:34,499
But...

182
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:37,319
there's one more thing you have to do.

183
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:39,840
What is it?

184
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,639
You have to draw the same one too

185
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:45,159
I'll check at lunch.

186
00:14:47,519 --> 00:14:48,679
This is

187
00:14:49,159 --> 00:14:51,000
my heart for Mr. Ji.

188
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,000
Then

189
00:14:53,297 --> 00:14:53,856
Mr. Ji's...

190
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:55,080
Of course you draw that too.

191
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:56,960
Where is my heart?

192
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:59,440
Don't you know?

193
00:15:46,759 --> 00:15:47,759
What about Xiao Ning?

194
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,600
Xiao Ning has a
nanny watching her.

195
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:52,120
It's rare for us to have a date alone.

196
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,320
Whatever Mr. Ji decides.

197
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,000
What's wrong?

198
00:16:14,399 --> 00:16:16,360
I'm checking if they're different.

199
00:16:16,799 --> 00:16:18,360
They're clearly exactly the same!

200
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:21,480
Mm.

201
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,440
This...

202
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,000
This doesn't feel right.

203
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:30,120
So what?

204
00:16:37,159 --> 00:16:39,320
I might still have to go
back in a couple days.

205
00:16:39,639 --> 00:16:40,639
If I don't go back soon

206
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,960
my crew at the studio is gonna revolt.

207
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:46,000
You actually hired people to work for you?

208
00:16:46,919 --> 00:16:47,919
Guys or girls?

209
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,480
Girls.

210
00:16:50,639 --> 00:16:52,679
They've all got boyfriends
they're about to marry.

211
00:16:55,559 --> 00:16:57,080
Haven't been back to H City in ages.

212
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,960
Wonder what it looks like now.

213
00:17:01,039 --> 00:17:03,080
Go check it out once you're done.

214
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,480
Sure.

215
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:07,359
Once I wrap things up here,

216
00:17:07,759 --> 00:17:08,880
I'll come find you.

217
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,200
Okay.

218
00:17:45,519 --> 00:17:46,519
What's wrong?

219
00:17:49,359 --> 00:17:50,359
Nothing.

220
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:53,040
Just some mess I should've
dealt with long ago.

221
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:02,799
Uncle Shen, I missed you so much.

222
00:18:02,839 --> 00:18:03,839
Oh my.

223
00:18:04,319 --> 00:18:05,919
Didn't we just see each other yesterday?

224
00:18:07,319 --> 00:18:09,559
I wanna play with Uncle Shen every day.

225
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:10,319
Okay.

226
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:12,535
Then I'll play with Xiao Ning
every day from now on, okay?

227
00:18:12,559 --> 00:18:13,359
Mm.

228
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,838
Let me tell you a joke.

229
00:18:15,839 --> 00:18:16,879
You tell me one.

230
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:17,519
Mm.

231
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,480
What are you gonna tell me?

232
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:19,160
Go on.

233
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:20,240
A joke.

234
00:18:21,519 --> 00:18:22,279
There once

235
00:18:22,279 --> 00:18:23,160
There once was a bird.

236
00:18:23,161 --> 00:18:25,039
It was a woodpecker.

237
00:18:25,319 --> 00:18:26,319
Mm.

238
00:18:26,599 --> 00:18:28,880
It went to a tree to catch bugs.

239
00:18:29,119 --> 00:18:31,880
Then the tree said, I'm not sick.

240
00:18:32,160 --> 00:18:33,160
And then?

241
00:18:33,799 --> 00:18:36,399
Then the woodpecker said, if
you're not sick, walk a couple steps.

242
00:18:41,839 --> 00:18:42,440
Alright.

243
00:18:42,839 --> 00:18:43,839
Time for bed.

244
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,558
I want a bedtime story

245
00:18:46,559 --> 00:18:48,519
I want Uncle Shen to tell it.

246
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:50,839
Okay.

247
00:18:51,039 --> 00:18:52,039
For Xiao Ning.

248
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,440
Let's go.

249
00:18:57,079 --> 00:18:58,679
Uncle Shen, tell it to me too.

250
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:00,961
The story of the big bad
wolf and the little white rabbit.

251
00:19:02,599 --> 00:19:03,599
Okay.

252
00:19:03,697 --> 00:19:07,525
Once upon a time, there was a
big bad wolf and a little white rabbit.

253
00:19:37,706 --> 00:19:42,105
But in the end, the little
rabbit beat the big bad wolf.

254
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,200
And protected herself.

255
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:47,279
That's not how Daddy told it.

256
00:19:48,119 --> 00:19:49,119
Hmm.

257
00:19:49,279 --> 00:19:51,079
How did Daddy tell it?

258
00:19:52,496 --> 00:19:55,881
Daddy said the big bad wolf and the
little white rabbit stay together forever.

259
00:19:57,079 --> 00:19:58,079
Daddy.

260
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:01,240
Daddy.

261
00:20:06,039 --> 00:20:07,118
Dad's too tired.

262
00:20:07,119 --> 00:20:08,359
Let him get some sleep.

263
00:20:09,079 --> 00:20:10,039
You get some sleep too.

264
00:20:10,039 --> 00:20:11,039
Mm.

265
00:20:12,359 --> 00:20:13,359
Be good.

266
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:58,000
Long time no see,

267
00:20:59,759 --> 00:21:00,880
my Mr. Ji.

268
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:35,480
That's how it was.

269
00:21:35,660 --> 00:21:37,420
I stayed on the island a few more days.

270
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:41,119
Had a great time with
Ji Mingxuan and his son.

271
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:43,400
Before I booked a new flight home.

272
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:48,999
These past years I've mainly worked abroad.

273
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,599
My career's shifted overseas too.

274
00:21:50,839 --> 00:21:51,400
Mm.

275
00:21:51,401 --> 00:21:54,480
Once I'm done, I'll come back to you.

276
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:55,920
Mm

277
00:21:56,039 --> 00:21:57,039
I'll wait for you.

278
00:22:00,599 --> 00:22:02,240
Where are you going, mister?

279
00:22:03,279 --> 00:22:04,440
I'm going home.

280
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:06,519
Then when will you come back?

281
00:22:07,359 --> 00:22:07,880
Mm.

282
00:22:08,039 --> 00:22:09,519
Probably not for a while.

283
00:22:10,759 --> 00:22:11,838
No, don't go.

284
00:22:11,839 --> 00:22:13,199
Can't you stay?

285
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:15,039
Come with me, okay.

286
00:22:15,359 --> 00:22:16,799
Uncle has to go back.

287
00:22:16,839 --> 00:22:17,720
But when the time comes

288
00:22:17,721 --> 00:22:19,679
you can come visit
Uncle's place with Daddy.

289
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:20,400
Okay?

290
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:20,920
Really?

291
00:22:20,921 --> 00:22:21,959
Then pinky swear with me.

292
00:22:21,960 --> 00:22:22,720
Pinky swear.

293
00:22:22,799 --> 00:22:24,799
Pinky swear, pinky swear.

294
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:26,640
If Uncle lies

295
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:27,720
then punish me

296
00:22:30,279 --> 00:22:31,799
to be carried off by the big bad wolf.

297
00:22:31,839 --> 00:22:33,959
Uncle, don't ever get
carried off by the big bad wolf

298
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:35,880
or I'll never see you again.

299
00:22:36,279 --> 00:22:37,439
Daddy has a photo of Uncle

300
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:38,519
I don't have one.

301
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:41,480
What photo?

302
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:45,119
The one Daddy keeps in his wallet.

303
00:22:46,599 --> 00:22:47,599
Hehehe.

304
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:49,200
Alright, Xiao Ning.

305
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:50,359
Uncle has to get on the plane.

306
00:22:50,360 --> 00:22:52,038
Stop pestering Uncle, got it.

307
00:22:52,039 --> 00:22:52,680
Oh.

308
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:53,680
Mm

309
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:54,960
Mr. Ji.

310
00:22:55,039 --> 00:22:56,039
What photo?

311
00:22:56,805 --> 00:22:57,805
Uh.

312
00:23:01,559 --> 00:23:02,519
I'm a bit thirsty.

313
00:23:02,519 --> 00:23:03,519
I'm gonna go buy some water

314
00:23:03,599 --> 00:23:05,720
Mr. Ji, lend me your wallet for a sec.

315
00:23:07,079 --> 00:23:08,079
I'll go buy it for you.

316
00:23:16,137 --> 00:23:17,775
No wonder Ji Ning felt so close

317
00:23:17,799 --> 00:23:19,039
to me the moment we met.

318
00:23:19,279 --> 00:23:20,960
Seems it's not without reason.

319
00:23:21,279 --> 00:23:22,279
It's just...

320
00:23:23,119 --> 00:23:24,518
In Mr. Ji's wallet

321
00:23:24,519 --> 00:23:25,920
which photo of me is in there?

322
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:27,839
I don't like taking photos.

323
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:31,000
Don't recall ever taking one with Mr. Ji.

324
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,920
The ones I took before

325
00:23:34,186 --> 00:23:36,305
were all left in that rental place.

326
00:23:37,079 --> 00:23:38,759
Where did Mr. Ji get a photo?

327
00:23:44,559 --> 00:23:45,559
Hmm.

328
00:23:47,599 --> 00:23:49,039
So what is that photo?

329
00:23:49,279 --> 00:23:50,679
Just let me see it.

330
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,680
Just one look.

331
00:23:51,880 --> 00:23:52,920
There's no photo.

332
00:23:54,279 --> 00:23:55,200
Come on

333
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,200
I'm begging you.

334
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,119
Let me see it

335
00:23:57,120 --> 00:23:58,480
I'm really curious.

336
00:23:59,240 --> 00:24:00,759
Curiosity killed the cat.

337
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:03,159
I'm boarding soon.

338
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:04,558
You wouldn't want me on the plane

339
00:24:04,559 --> 00:24:06,319
thinking about this the whole time, right?

340
00:24:08,039 --> 00:24:10,200
Xiao Ning, tell Uncle.

341
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,920
Is that photo a good one?

342
00:24:15,279 --> 00:24:16,279
Alright, Xiao Ning.

343
00:24:21,680 --> 00:24:22,680
Looks great.

344
00:24:25,079 --> 00:24:26,599
That's not what I asked.

345
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,000
Alright.

346
00:24:29,599 --> 00:24:30,599
You should get going too.

347
00:24:34,599 --> 00:24:35,599
I'm heading off.

348
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:37,160
Bye, Xiao Ning.

349
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:39,240
Goodbye, Uncle Shen.

350
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:42,640
Bye.

351
00:24:59,559 --> 00:25:00,359
Hey.

352
00:25:00,559 --> 00:25:01,559
Boss.

353
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:03,279
You're finally back.

354
00:25:03,759 --> 00:25:05,199
Why were you gone so long this time?

355
00:25:05,880 --> 00:25:06,680
Mm

356
00:25:06,843 --> 00:25:08,041
I felt pretty good actually,

357
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:09,319
I just stayed a few extra days.

358
00:25:10,505 --> 00:25:11,626
A few extra days?

359
00:25:12,599 --> 00:25:14,160
Don't tell me there was a romantic encounter.

360
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:16,720
A romantic encounter...

361
00:25:17,805 --> 00:25:20,565
Ji Mingxuan and I, reunited after so long.

362
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,320
Does that count as a romantic encounter?

363
00:25:22,359 --> 00:25:23,558
Oh, stop overthinking.

364
00:25:23,559 --> 00:25:24,559
Get to work.

365
00:25:24,599 --> 00:25:26,199
In a few days the
students will be on break.

366
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:28,078
Plenty of students will
want to learn painting.

367
00:25:28,079 --> 00:25:29,799
Let's get this ad out there.

368
00:25:31,319 --> 00:25:33,720
Who knows, we might even
get some business out of it.

369
00:25:34,039 --> 00:25:35,039
Boss.

370
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:37,440
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

371
00:25:37,839 --> 00:25:40,758
Aren't we always slacking
off whenever we can?

372
00:25:40,759 --> 00:25:43,559
How come you suddenly turned into
someone who seems so hardworking?

373
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:44,880
I'm not that lazy.

374
00:25:46,319 --> 00:25:47,319
Besides.

375
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:48,920
Things are different now.

376
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:50,720
How are they different?

377
00:25:51,579 --> 00:25:52,579
Because...

378
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:55,440
I need to make money to support a family.

379
00:25:56,079 --> 00:25:57,079
Huh?

380
00:26:02,799 --> 00:26:04,599
Don't tell me you're getting married.

381
00:26:05,278 --> 00:26:06,278
How did it happen?

382
00:26:06,680 --> 00:26:08,599
Was it love at first sight abroad?

383
00:26:10,079 --> 00:26:11,000
Then I know.

384
00:26:11,001 --> 00:26:13,799
It must've been a
romantic meeting by the sea.

385
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:15,519
Just like in a movie, right?

386
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:16,640
What's she like?

387
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:17,279
Is she pretty?

388
00:26:17,280 --> 00:26:18,400
Does she have a good temper?

389
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:21,160
Go cleaning already.

390
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,519
Look how dirty this floor is.

391
00:26:25,839 --> 00:26:26,839
Oh.

392
00:26:27,079 --> 00:26:28,640
Someone's coming later.

393
00:26:29,265 --> 00:26:30,265
Is it the boss lady?

394
00:26:31,839 --> 00:26:32,839
Go clean up.

395
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:35,000
Of course.

396
00:26:43,319 --> 00:26:44,119
Ah.

397
00:26:44,119 --> 00:26:44,880
Hello.

398
00:26:44,920 --> 00:26:46,279
Welcome to Mo Art Studio.

399
00:26:46,319 --> 00:26:47,519
How can I help you?

400
00:26:49,039 --> 00:26:49,839
Boss.

401
00:26:49,840 --> 00:26:50,880
He's here for you.

402
00:26:59,240 --> 00:27:00,240
Wai—wait wait.

403
00:27:02,559 --> 00:27:03,559
It's you.

404
00:27:05,119 --> 00:27:06,119
So you're the boss la-

405
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:11,880
Hello.

406
00:27:12,226 --> 00:27:13,226
You're Yang Yue, right?

407
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:15,079
Hello, hello.

408
00:27:15,119 --> 00:27:16,119
Boss lady.

409
00:27:17,599 --> 00:27:18,599
That's right.

410
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,160
I'm the boss.

411
00:27:20,759 --> 00:27:22,039
Aren't you the boss lady?

412
00:27:23,599 --> 00:27:24,119
Uh

413
00:27:24,120 --> 00:27:25,679
I'll leave you two lovebirds alone.

414
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:26,680
Bye.

415
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:30,880
Where's Xiao Ning?

416
00:27:30,920 --> 00:27:32,319
How come he didn't come with you?

417
00:27:33,359 --> 00:27:34,359
He's home playing.

418
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:37,680
Oh.

419
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:38,680
Oh right.

420
00:27:38,799 --> 00:27:40,199
Now you can't run away.

421
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:41,200
Tell me now.

422
00:27:41,759 --> 00:27:43,680
What photo of me did you hide anyway?

423
00:27:44,039 --> 00:27:45,039
You still remember that?

424
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,200
I just do.

425
00:27:46,519 --> 00:27:47,519
Let me see it now.

426
00:27:56,519 --> 00:27:58,000
This is way too ugly.

427
00:27:58,839 --> 00:27:59,839
How is it ugly?

428
00:28:00,279 --> 00:28:01,319
It's cute.

429
00:28:01,960 --> 00:28:02,960
You have no idea.

430
00:28:03,559 --> 00:28:04,839
All those years you were gone.

431
00:28:05,599 --> 00:28:07,599
Just holding onto it was how I got through.

432
00:28:10,119 --> 00:28:11,119
But.

433
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:13,519
I think this was taken
when I was in school.

434
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:15,839
Where did you get it?

435
00:28:17,880 --> 00:28:19,519
I bet you don't even remember.

436
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:23,359
You once sent your resume to my company.

437
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,480
Ah.

438
00:28:30,680 --> 00:28:32,000
But after all that back and forth

439
00:28:33,079 --> 00:28:34,640
you still ended up mine.

440
00:28:36,839 --> 00:28:37,839
No way.

441
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:41,200
What's so funny.

442
00:28:42,400 --> 00:28:43,720
You definitely don't remember.

443
00:28:44,559 --> 00:28:46,400
Actually, I saw you long ago.

444
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:50,559
Wasn't our first meeting when you saved me?

445
00:28:51,100 --> 00:28:52,660
I was picking up An'an at T University.

446
00:28:53,079 --> 00:28:54,640
You were riding a bike.

447
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:58,519
Loaded with paint and art supplies.

448
00:29:02,986 --> 00:29:03,986
Ah.

449
00:29:04,119 --> 00:29:05,000
Oh my god

450
00:29:05,001 --> 00:29:06,440
I'm so dumb.

451
00:29:07,160 --> 00:29:08,119
How embarrassing.

452
00:29:08,120 --> 00:29:09,319
Was I that dumb back then?

453
00:29:19,759 --> 00:29:20,759
Okay.

454
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:22,400
I'll be right there.

455
00:29:23,680 --> 00:29:24,680
What's wrong?

456
00:29:27,279 --> 00:29:28,279
Don't worry.

457
00:29:28,799 --> 00:29:30,240
Just a small thing at work.

458
00:29:31,599 --> 00:29:32,599
Once I'm done

459
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:33,880
I'll come pick you up tonight.

460
00:29:34,359 --> 00:29:35,160
Okay.

461
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:36,200
Then stay safe.

462
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:37,440
Mm.

463
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:49,880
Mm.

464
00:29:52,319 --> 00:29:53,119
Boss.

465
00:29:53,120 --> 00:29:54,358
You're so lucky.

466
00:29:54,359 --> 00:29:55,759
Your wife is so handsome.

467
00:29:55,799 --> 00:29:57,359
How do you just pop out of nowhere?

468
00:29:58,359 --> 00:29:59,440
Sorry, sorry.

469
00:30:00,039 --> 00:30:00,559
Oh.

470
00:30:00,559 --> 00:30:01,279
Right.

471
00:30:01,280 --> 00:30:02,840
There's something I forgot to tell you.

472
00:30:03,400 --> 00:30:04,400
What is it?

473
00:30:04,599 --> 00:30:06,599
Someone came looking
for you a couple days ago.

474
00:30:07,279 --> 00:30:08,079
Looking for me?

475
00:30:08,079 --> 00:30:08,599
Mm.

476
00:30:08,599 --> 00:30:09,599
Who.

477
00:30:09,839 --> 00:30:11,758
Just a pretty tall guy.

478
00:30:11,759 --> 00:30:13,200
And pretty handsome too.

479
00:30:13,359 --> 00:30:14,000
Oh man.

480
00:30:14,001 --> 00:30:16,480
But not as tall or
handsome as our boss lady.

481
00:30:16,960 --> 00:30:17,559
Uh.

482
00:30:17,560 --> 00:30:18,680
Wearing glasses.

483
00:30:18,759 --> 00:30:19,759
His name was...

484
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:21,480
Zhou Yang.

485
00:30:24,752 --> 00:30:25,833
What does he want with me?

486
00:30:27,279 --> 00:30:28,279
He didn't say.

487
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:30,880
He just said to contact
him the moment you're back.

488
00:30:31,279 --> 00:30:32,759
He kept stressing it too.

489
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:35,240
Must be something urgent.

490
00:30:37,839 --> 00:30:38,839
Yang.

491
00:30:39,599 --> 00:30:42,000
What's he doing,
popping up all of a sudden?
